### How to Handle TypeError: Unhashable Type ‘Dict’ Exception in Python

> The Python Unhashable Type ‘Dict’ exception usually occurs when trying to hash an unhashable object like a dictionary. Learn how to fix it.

- Published: 2023-04-11
- Modified: 2023-04-11
