### Apache Kafka Example: How Rollbar Removed Technical Debt - Part 2

- Published: 2020-04-07
- Modified: 2021-09-20
- URL: https://rollbar.com/blog/apache-kafka-example-how-rollbar-removed-technical-debt-part-2/
